Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 21:01:07 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 36/47] metal: CPU gridding + vkFFT engine
 (MX_METAL_ENGINE=cpu-vkfft)

Grids on the CPU with the same tap window, polynomial coefficients and
centred frame as the Metal kernel (grid matches to 4.1e-07), transforms
with vkFFT on a shared MTLBuffer (matches ducc0 c2c to 3.5e-07), and
shares one extractPlane() with the Metal engine.

Gates: 1024 rel_rms 4.83e-06, 4096/2amin 5.25e-06 (T2 PASS).
Speed: 3.6s (1024) and 7.2s (4096) vs ducc0 1.1s/2.65s - correct but not
yet faster; w-gridding bookkeeping is now the whole bottleneck.

